WEBVTT

00:10:28.993 --> 00:10:31.209
Danas smo naučili da

00:10:31.209 --> 00:10:33.616
smanjenje zagađenja i emisije gasova

00:10:33.616 --> 00:10:37.122
zapravo stvara zaradu.

00:10:37.122 --> 00:10:39.190
Štedi novac.

00:10:39.190 --> 00:10:40.888
Čini firmu produktivnijom i efikasnijom.

00:10:40.888 --> 00:10:42.285
Ne traći sirovine.

00:10:42.285 --> 00:10:44.928
A bezbednije radno okruženje,

00:10:44.928 --> 00:10:46.416
i izbegavanje nezgoda,

00:10:46.416 --> 00:10:47.788
čine firmu profitabilnijom

00:10:47.788 --> 00:10:50.996
jer predstavljaju znak
dobrog napretka.

00:10:50.996 --> 00:10:55.027
Nezgode su skupe.

00:10:55.027 --> 00:10:57.631
Posmatrajući problem po problem
počinjemo da shvatamo

00:10:57.631 --> 00:11:00.597
da zapravo nema suprotnosti